WEBVTT

00:01:56.208 --> 00:02:00.768
And she said, "Well, they're just
not smart enough to accept you right now,

00:02:00.792 --> 00:02:02.851
and they don't know
how excellent you are."

00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:04.143
(Cheers)

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:07.750
(Applause and cheers)

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:12.726
Well, I didn't know what that meant.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.476
(Laughter)

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.268
But I was sure it wasn't good,

00:02:17.292 --> 00:02:20.226
because I could see it
in my mother's eyes.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.518
She was angry,

00:02:23.542 --> 00:02:26.167
and it looked like she was
on the verge of tears.

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:30.851
Well, I decided right then and right there